    "vendor_compat_dtb_checked": false,
    "runtime_verified": true,
    "runtime_scope": "The v7.3.1 OS-facing DTB with the PM8150L flash/V4L2 link booted on the deployed RMX1931 through two ordinary reboots after the thin-private Image replacement. All four camera sensors each produced two complete private RAW frames, the LED-flash class and V4L2 flash subdevice were present, and Wi-Fi/NCM/SSH recovered on the same boot. All three MAX98937/AW8697 custom status nodes are absent while standard ALSA and input/FF remain. The installed Bluetooth host modules auto-loaded and the NFC nfc0/neard controller path passed without a physical tag. Multi-SKU, an externally removed-power cold boot, tag I/O and an accepted suspend/resume run remain open.",
    "statement": "This file is the machine-readable contract for the OS-facing platform. Runtime verification is limited to the deployed hardware and functions listed in the v7.3.1 source lock."
  },
